# Jet-hybrid scoping model output (jet_hybrid_model.py)

PG25 ~50 C: nu 1.244e-06 m2/s, Pr 9.45; j = 2.56 cm/s at 18 LPM, 5.13 at 36 LPM over 117 cm2

## A. Bare-surface round-jet arrays with distributed returns, 117 cm2 uniform (H/D = 2)

Continuity fixes the jet velocity: Vj = j / Ar, j = flow / footprint (2.56 cm/s at 18 LPM). h = area-averaged base h (no fins). dP = jet loss (1/Cd^2 + 1 dynamic heads, Cd 0.75) + 3.5 kPa ports/manifold.

